#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/network_management.rst:21
msgid ""
"In this case, there is a minimal configuration that is created as default "
"when the cloud gets created with the network mode set to Unmanaged network. "
"This minimal configuration includes a default Resource Pool that can be used"
" to associate compute servers with, and a default unmanaged network that is "
"available during instance provisioning to attach with compute servers."
msgstr ""
"In este case, allí es un minimal configuración que es creado as "
"predeterminado cuando la nube gets creado con la red modo set to Unmanaged "
"network. This minimal configuración includes un predeterminado Resource Pool"
" que se puede utilizar para associate compute servers con, y un "
"predeterminado unmanaged network que es disponible durante instance "
"provisioning to attach con compute servers."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/network_management.rst:23
msgid ""
"The default unmanaged network is configured as an untagged network with DHCP"
" as the IP allocation method. This allows a compute instance provisioned to "
"come up with network connectivity without any specific network configuration"
" required from the user."
msgstr ""
"The predeterminado unmanaged network es configurado as un untagged network "
"con DHCP as el IP allocation método. This allows un compute instance "
"provisioned to come up con network connectivity sin cualquier específico "
"network configuración requerido desde el usuario."

