#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/network_management.rst:157
msgid ""
"Networks are attached to interfaces on a compute server. The interfaces can "
"be the physical ports themselves or bond interfaces that combine two "
"physical ports into an aggregated pipe. Bond interfaces provide the benefits"
" of aggregated bandwidth on a single interface and also high availability by"
" providing port-level redundancy."
msgstr ""
"Networks son attached to interfaces on un compute server. The interfaces "
"puede be el physical ports themselves o bond interfaces que combine two "
"physical ports en un aggregated pipe. Bond interfaces provide el benefits of"
" aggregated bandwidth on un único interfaz y también high availability by "
"providing puerto-level redundancy."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/network_management.rst:159
msgid ""
"Once the decision is made on what kind of interfaces to use, networks can be"
" chosen from the preconfigured list to attach to the network interfaces. "
"This determines which VLANs are configured on which switch ports (or LAGs). "
"As mentioned earlier, the primary VLAN is provisioned as an untagged VLAN, "
"and the trunk VLANs are provisioned as tagged VLANs on the server ports."
msgstr ""
"Once el decision es made on what kind of interfaces to use, networks puede "
"be chosen desde el preconfigured lista to attach to la red interfaces. This "
"determines cual VLANs son configurado on cual switch ports (o LAGs). As "
"mentioned earlier, el primario VLAN es provisioned as un untagged VLAN, y el"
" trunk VLANs son provisioned as tagged VLANs on el servidor ports."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/network_management.rst:161
msgid "The supported bond types are:"
msgstr "The compatible bond types son:"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/network_management.rst:162
msgid ""
"Static Bond: This uses an L2+L3-based hash on the server OS and a static LAG"
" on the switches."
msgstr ""
"Static Bond: This uses un L2+L3-based hash on el servidor OS y un static LAG"
" on el switches."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/network_management.rst:163
msgid ""
"LACP Bond: This uses the LACP mode on the server OS and LACP LAG on the "
"switches."
msgstr ""
"LACP Bond: This uses el LACP modo on el servidor OS y LACP LAG on el "
"switches."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hpe_bare_metal/network_management.rst:164
msgid ""
"Switch Independent Bond: This uses the balance-tlb mode on Linux servers and"
" the switch-independent mode on Windows. The switch is configured as "
"independent physical ports."
msgstr ""
"Switch Independent Bond: This uses el balance-tlb modo on Linux servers y el"
" switch-independent modo on Windows. The switch es configurado as "
"independent physical ports."

