msgid ""
"For physical interfaces, the interfaces represent the physical ports in "
"their display order. Virtual networks specify that tagged networks under the"
" primary network specified are to be configured on the server OS with an IP "
"interface. If any of those tagged networks are not required to be configured"
" on the server OS as an IP interface, do not specify a virtual interface for"
" those."
msgstr ""
"For physical interfaces, el interfaces represent el physical ports in their "
"display order. Virtual networks specify que tagged networks under el "
"primario network especificado son to be configurado on el servidor OS con un"
" IP interfaz. If cualquier of esos tagged networks no son requerido to be "
"configurado on el servidor OS as un IP interfaz, no specify un virtual "
"interfaz para esos."
